ainer may want to confirm that choice.\n- The optional gitleaks pass and the PII pass both fail closed, so a PII false positive could block commits. Allow-list tuning deserves a careful review.\n# ard configuration for albertcbrown/ard (dogfooding). Started from `ard init`'s\n# template; human-owned. ard serve reads it from origin/main.\n# Anything unset takes its built-in default (docs/proposal.md, Configuration).\n# Validate with `ard config check`. ard serve reads this file from origin/main.\n\n# label: only issues a maintainer labels for triage enter the pipeline.\n# all: every human-filed issue enters.\nintake: { mode: label }\n\n# Loop poll intervals. Unset loops keep their defaults (scanners 4h, triage\n# 15m, workers 5m, reviewers 5m, prwatch 5m); 1m is the minimum. Hand-offs\n# no longer wait for a poll: a close-out wakes the next loop, a freed slot\n# wakes loops with waiting work, and approvals and unblocks are watched every\n# minute (#394, #406). The merger is controller code with no agent or job\n# slot, so it polls every minute to merge green PRs sooner.\nintervals: { merger: 1m }\n\nmerge:\n  # A PR touching any of these waits for a human approval. There is no\n  # built-in list: removing an entry removes its gate. An entry ending in /\n  # is a directory prefix; anything else is a glob (quote globs starting with *).\n  protected_paths:\n    - .github/\n    - .ard/config.yaml\n    - .ard/scanners/\n    - .ard/triage/\n    - .ard/workers/\n    - .ard/reviewers/\n    - \"**/CODEOWNERS\"\n    # Agent instructions a PR could plant to steer later agents.\n    - CLAUDE.md\n    - \"**/CLAUDE.md\"\n    - AGENTS.md\n    - \"**/AGENTS.md\"\n    - .claude/\n    - .mcp.json\n    # What builds, signs and deploys ard itself (docs/proposal.md, Delivery).\n    - \"Jenkinsfile*\"\n    - Dockerfile\n    - .dockerignore\n    - deploy/\n\noverrides:\n  scanners/cve: { every: 6h, max_open: 10, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  # Phase 1 agent roles (the ard init starter set, #39 Gate 2).\n  triage/lead:  { model: claude-opus-5-5, timeout: 15m }\n  triage/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\n  workers/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5, timeout: 60m, tests: make lint test }\n  reviewers/eng-review: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\nCLAUDE.md\nDockerfile\nLICENSE\nMakefile\nREADME.md\ncmd\ndeploy\ndocs\ngo.mod\ngo.sum\ninternal\nmkdocs.yml\ninternal:\nagent\nagentjob\nbotcheck\nbudget\ncli\ncloseout\ncommitter\nconfig\nconfigcmd\nconfigsrc\ncontroller\ncostblock\ncosts\ndigest\ndocscheck\neffects\nexecutor\ngithub\ngitref\ngitx\nimagescan\ninitcmd\nintake\njanitor\njobexec\njobpod\njobpost\njobpre\nlabels\nlimits\nmerger\nmodelauth\npool\nprgate\nprwatch\nreaper\nredact\nrepopath\nreviewer\nreviewfix\nroles\nscanner\nservecmd\nsetupcmd\nsnapshot\nstate\ntarball\ntriage\nui\nversioncheck\nworker\nwtlock\n\ninternal/closeout:\nallow.go\nallow_test.go\ncause_test.go\ncloseout.go\ncloser_test.go\ncomment.go\ncomment_test.go\ncommit.go\ndoc.go\nenv_test.go\nfacts.go\nleadworker_test.go\nnetwork.go\nnetwork_test.go\nnext.go\npaths.go\npaths_test.go\nplan.go\nplan_merge.go\nplan_merge_test.go\nplan_test.go\nprepare.go\nprepare_allow_test.go\nprepare_test.go\nprgone_test.go\nreview.go\nreview_test.go\nrolefile.go\nrolefile_test.go\nround_test.go\ntestdata\nusage.go\nusage_test.go\nwake.go\nwake_test.go\nworker.go\nworker_test.go\n     366 internal/closeout/allow.go\n      85 internal/closeout/allow_test.go\n     387 internal/closeout/cause_test.go\n     945 internal/closeout/closeout.go\n     771 internal/closeout/closer_test.go\n     236 internal/closeout/comment.go\n     148 internal/closeout/comment_test.go\n      32 internal/closeout/commit.go\n      58 internal/closeout/doc.go\n     360 internal/closeout/env_test.go\n      44 internal/closeout/facts.go\n      60 internal/closeout/leadworker_test.go\n     215 internal/closeout/network.go\n     388 internal/closeout/network_test.go\n      92 internal/closeout/next.go\n      99 internal